{"name":"Eburnean","hex":"#ffffee","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"eburnean","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Made of ivory.","As white as ivory."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/eburnean"}],"entries":[{"title":"Eburnean orogeny","blocks":[{"text":"The Eburnean orogeny, or Eburnean cycle, was a series of tectonic, metamorphic and plutonic events in what is now West Africa during the Paleoproterozoic era about 2200–2000 million years ago.\nDuring this period the Birimian domain in West Africa was established and structured."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d4/USGS_geologic_map_Ghana.png/330px-USGS_geologic_map_Ghana.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eburnean_orogeny","wikidata":"Q5332113"},{"title":"Eburnean Democratic Bloc","blocks":[{"text":"Eburnean Democratic Bloc, was a splinter group of the Democratic Party of Côte d'Ivoire (PDCI) formed in 1949. BDE opposed what they saw as the 'submission' of PDCI under the French Communist Party (PCF)."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9d/Coat_of_Arms_of_the_Ivory_Coast.svg/330px-Coat_of_Arms_of_the_Ivory_Coast.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eburnean_Democratic_Bloc","wikidata":"Q5332112"}],"images":[],"sounds":{},"pictures":[{"title":"Piece of chocolate cake on a white plate decorated with chocolate sauce","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ef/Piece_of_chocolate_cake_on_a_white_plate_decorated_with_chocolate_sauce.jpg/500px-Piece_of_chocolate_cake_on_a_white_plate_decorated_with_chocolate_sauce.jpg","ratio":1.4699946893255444,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Piece_of_chocolate_cake_on_a_white_plate_decorated_with_chocolate_sauce.jpg","share":0.208125},{"title":"Strawberry on white background","image":"h